### Worker API Layer (`marketplace/server/`)

#### [NEW] [worker.js](file:///c:/Users/Jalaj%20Legion/Documents/Telegram%20Mini%20App/marketplace/server/worker.js)
- Cloudflare Worker backend using Hono framework:
  - Telegram HMAC signature authentication middleware (`c.req.header('x-telegram-init-data')`).
  - `GET /api/user/me`: Returns Telegram user profile and listed products from D1.
  - `GET /api/products`: Search, category/price/location filtering, and sorting powered by D1 SQL prepared statements.
  - `GET /api/products/:id`: Fetch single product & increment D1 view counter.
  - `POST /api/products`: Create listing in D1.
  - `PUT /api/products/:id`: Update listing in D1 with creator ownership enforcement.
  - `DELETE /api/products/:id`: Delete listing in D1 with creator ownership enforcement.
  - `POST /api/upload`: Process image uploads (base64 / data URIs).

