1. `npx wrangler d1 execute tg-marketplace-db --local --file=schema.sql` to initialize local D1 database.
2. `npm run build` to verify React Vite production compilation.
3. `npx wrangler dev` to start Cloudflare Worker local emulator and verify API routes return 200 OK.

### Manual Verification
1. Test creating, searching, sorting, and editing products against local Cloudflare D1 simulation.
